Z||000008||william_thorniii||10-26-2000||08:10 AM||||Friends,<P>Have you no taste?  Are you not tired of seeing spoilers on everything from Geo Metro's to Chrysler Mini-vans?  Keep it original and wingless.  If you must add a wing, make sure that you sub out the decklid and keep the original one stock.  The simple matter of fact is that the plain lid GT's are more rare and MUCH more understated... which is better looking to many.<P>Off of my soap box now...<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||13
